    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk man, if people realize the \"low stock\" warning is fake we might get shitposted on or lose trust. i'm worried it'll backfire if they see we actually have plenty. what if we just told the front-end to show \"only 5 left\" even though we know there's more? would that be too risky for the brand, or is the margin boost worth it?",
